          "Is this actually a contradiction, and what evidence or context explains it?",
        recommendedAction:
          "Review the competing versions and document the explanation.",
        whatToCompare: [
          "Narrative",
          "Evidence",
          "Timeline",
          "Pleadings",
          "Messages",
          "Witness statements",
        ],
        whatWouldResolveIt: [
          "Exact wording",
          "Original document",
          "Dates",
