    Assembly --> LitigationReasoning[LitigationReasoning]
    LitigationReasoning --> Authority[Authority Intelligence]
    Authority --> Workflow[Workflow]
    Workflow --> UI[UI / Pages / Documents]
```

## Rule

No page, workflow, package, or AI feature should hard-code legal authority.

All authority must flow through:

```text
